  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_HG_StA409g</defName>
    <label>StA-409 Keyzer</label>
    <description>Allegedly commissioned by Hera Visari herself as part of an initiative to modernize Helghan armaments, the '409 is a staple of post-diaspora regimes. When Stahl Arms was told to iterate upon their iconic assault rifle, they took lessons learned from latter production years and rolled them into the 409, No overcomplicated  dual weapon system, balanced ultralight materials, and a focus on mass production. The Keyzer is an oddity- clearly a post-industrial design by a spacer tech civilization, but lacking any sophisticated technology, It was an attempt to create a modernized ballistic weapon capable of being rolled out army-wide in a rapidly evolving technological climate.\n\nIt does require a small amount of high grade metals for parts of the rifling and internal components, and its performance pales compared to the raw power of true energy weapons, but its quick to assemble, durable, and superior to conventional industrial assault rifles in just about every way.</description>
