  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastBaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>Gun_HG_StA59B</defName>
    <label>StA-59B Pulver</label>
    <description>Sometimes innovation requires radical re-evaluation of core design philosophy. Stahl Arms, asked for the next generation of mass produced infantry rifles, proposed numerous options to prevent VnS or Visari Corporation from stealing lucrative arms contracts. One of the results of this contract was the Pulver, a semi automatic battle rifle. The antiquated Sta-14 was nearing its end of life service even before the regime's wars began in earnest, The Pulver is the long awaited update; technically a semi automatic assault rifle, its armor piercing depleted uranium rounds defeat most infantry armor systems reliably. This next gen weapon was intended for designated marksmen to pick of high profile threats whilst the riflemen lay down coverfire, it was an example of Stahl's commitment to dominating the squad level ordinance industry.</description>
